      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "いいっていいって。\r\n紛らわしかったのはたしかだし。",
        "official_en": "Water under the bridge, my friend. Your suspicions were well warranted, given my attire.",
        "real_en": "It's fine, really. I can see why you'd be confused."
      },
